{
  "an3.69:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 3.69 ",
  "an3.69:0.2": "7. The Great Chapter ",
  "an3.69:0.3": "Unskillful Roots ",
  "an3.69:1.1": "“Mendicants, there are these three unskillful roots. ",
  "an3.69:1.2": "What three? ",
  "an3.69:1.3": "Greed, hate, and delusion. ",
  "an3.69:2.1": "Greed is a root of the unskillful. ",
  "an3.69:2.2": "When a greedy person chooses to act by way of body, speech, or mind, that too is unskillful. ",
  "an3.69:2.3": "When a greedy person, overcome by greed, causes another to suffer under a false pretext—by execution or imprisonment or confiscation or condemnation or banishment—thinking ‘I’m powerful, I want power’, that too is unskillful. ",
  "an3.69:2.4": "And so these many bad, unskillful things are produced in them, born, sourced, originated, and conditioned by greed. ",
  "an3.69:3.1": "Hate is a root of the unskillful. ",
  "an3.69:3.2": "When a hateful person chooses to act by way of body, speech, or mind, that too is unskillful. ",
  "an3.69:3.3": "When a hateful person, overcome by hate, causes another to suffer under a false pretext—by execution or imprisonment or confiscation or condemnation or banishment—thinking ‘I’m powerful, I want power’, that too is unskillful. ",
  "an3.69:3.4": "And so these many bad, unskillful things are produced in them, born, sourced, originated, and conditioned by hate. ",
  "an3.69:4.1": "Delusion is a root of the unskillful. ",
  "an3.69:4.2": "When a deluded person chooses to act by way of body, speech, or